 arrived at our Website. This data is aggregated and anonymous."}],["$","p","types-of-cookies-2",{"children":"C. Marketing & Advertising Cookies: These cookies are used to track visitors across websites and display relevant advertisements. Marketing cookies we may use include Google Ads cookies to measure ad performance and show personalized ads, and Meta Pixel to track conversions and show relevant ads on Meta properties. These cookies may track your activity across different websites to build a profile of your interests."}],["$","p","types-of-cookies-3",{"children":"D. Functional Cookies: These cookies remember your preferences and choices to provide enhanced functionality, including language and region preferences, display settings and customizations, previously viewed products, and form information for faster checkout. Disabling functional cookies may result in reduced functionality and a less personalized experience."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Essential Cookies cannot be disabled as they are required for core functionality."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Performance & Analytics Cookies help us understand how visitors use the Website."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Marketing & Advertising Cookies track activity across websites and help tailor ads."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Functional Cookies remember preferences such as language, display settings, and saved checkout info."}]]}],false,false]}]]}],["$","section","how-we-use-cookies",{"id":"how-we-use-cookies","className":"border-t border-slate-200 py-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#10233d] sm:text-3xl","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-3 text-[#0758cf]","children":["3","."]}],"How We Use Cookies"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600","children":[[["$","p","how-we-use-cookies-0",{"children":"We use cookies for purposes including enabling essential site functionality, analyzing and improving website performance, personalizing your shopping experience, and delivering targeted advertising based on your interests."}],["$","p","how-we-use-cookies-1",{"children":"We do not use cookies to collect information that directly identifies you without your consent."}]],false,false,false]}]]}],["$","section","third-party-cookies",{"id":"third-party-cookies","className":"border-t border-slate-200 py-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#10233d] sm:text-3xl","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-3 text-[#0758cf]","children":["4","."]}],"Third-Party Cookies"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600","children":[[["$","p","third-party-cookies-0",{"children":"Third parties may also set cookies when you visit our Website, including Google (Analytics, Ads, Tag Manager), Meta (Facebook Pixel), and payment processors for secure transactions."}],["$","p","third-party-cookies-1",{"children":"We do not control these cookies. Their use is subject to the privacy policies of the respective third parties."}]],false,false,false]}]]}],["$","section","your-cookie-choices",{"id":"your-cookie-choices","className":"border-t border-slate-200 py-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#10233d] sm:text-3xl","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-3 text-[#0758cf]","children":["5","."]}],"Your Cookie Choices"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600","children":[[["$","p","your-cookie-choices-0",{"children":"You can control cookies in the following ways:"}],["$","p","your-cookie-choices-1",{"children":"Browser Settings: Most browsers allow you to block cookies, delete cookies, or notify you when cookies are set. Disabling cookies may affect Website functionality, including your ability to make purchases or access certain features."}],